{"name":"Yeshpek","status":"ok","title":"Yeshpek","pageId":15899,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-frwiki pi-layout-default type-location\">\n\n\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Yeshpek</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Geography<sup id=\"cite_ref-MLoSaDC_1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-MLoSaDC-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-EotSS-p167_2-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-EotSS-p167-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"aliases\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Aliases</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">City of Chains</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"region\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Land_of_the_Lions\" title=\"Land of the Lions\">Land of the Lions</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/South_Faer%C3%BBn\" title=\"South Faerûn\">south Faerûn</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"size\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Size</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Large city</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Society<sup id=\"cite_ref-EotSS-p167_2-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-EotSS-p167-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"demonym\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Demonym</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Yeshen</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"races\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Races</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><b>City Citizens</b><br><table class=\"percentagetable\"><tbody><tr><td> <a href=\"/wiki/Human\" title=\"Human\">Human</a>  </td><td> 85%  </td></tr><tr><td> Other  </td><td> 15%  </td></tr></tbody></table><b>Outskirts Workers</b><br><table class=\"percentagetable\"><tbody><tr><td> <a href=\"/wiki/Human\" title=\"Human\">Human</a>  </td><td> 88%  </td></tr><tr><td> Other  </td><td> 12%  </td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Commerce<sup id=\"cite_ref-MLoSaDC_1-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-MLoSaDC-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"exports\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Exports</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Chain\" title=\"Chain\">Chains</a>, mercenaries</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Politics<sup id=\"cite_ref-EotSS-p167_2-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-EotSS-p167-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"ruler\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Ruler</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Khaldomaun\" title=\"Khaldomaun\">Khaldomaun</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">History<sup id=\"cite_ref-MLoSaDC_1-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-MLoSaDC-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-EotSS-p167_2-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-EotSS-p167-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"population1\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Population</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">19,000 city citizens, 4200 outskirts workers&#160;in <a href=\"/wiki/1372_DR\" title=\"1372 DR\">1372&#160;DR</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"ruler1\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Ruler</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ilbaerth_Malklyn\" title=\"Ilbaerth Malklyn\">Ilbaerth Malklyn</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Inhabitants_of_Yeshpek\" title=\"Category:Inhabitants of Yeshpek\">Inhabitants of  Yeshpek</a></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Locations_in_Yeshpek\" title=\"Category:Locations in Yeshpek\">Locations in  Yeshpek</a></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Organizations_in_Yeshpek\" title=\"Category:Organizations in Yeshpek\">Organizations in  Yeshpek</a></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><span class=\"DPL-purge plainlinks\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Template:Category_intersection_jump?DPL_cat1=Locations_in__Yeshpek&DPL_cat2=Roads&action=purge\">Roads  in  Yeshpek</a></span></nav>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Yeshpek</b> was a large fortified city in the <a href=\"/wiki/Land_of_the_Lions\" title=\"Land of the Lions\">Land of the Lions</a> region of <a href=\"/wiki/South_Faer%C3%BBn\" title=\"South Faerûn\">south Faerûn</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-MLoSaDC_1-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-MLoSaDC-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\"><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Etymology\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Etymology</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Geography\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Geography</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Trade\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Trade</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Notable_Locations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Notable Locations</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Businesses\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Businesses</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Temples\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Temples</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Roads\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Roads</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Inhabitants\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Inhabitants</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Appendix\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appendix</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#References\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">References</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Etymology\">Etymology</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Etymology\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Yeshpek?veaction=edit&section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Etymology\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Yeshpek was referred to by some as the City of Chains, due to its primary export. As for its proper name, a number of commentators and <a href=\"/wiki/Map\" title=\"Map\">mapmakers</a> in the lands north of Land of the Lions were known to misspell it on several occasions as Yeslipek. This was due to the city's name appearing blurry on a primary source map from the <span class=\"new\" title=\"Fifth Age of Calimshan (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvRmlmdGhfQWdlX29mX0NhbGltc2hhbj9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Fifth Age of Calimshan</span>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-EotSS-p167_2-4\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-EotSS-p167-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Geography\">Geography</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Geography\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Yeshpek?veaction=edit&section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Geography\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>This city was situated to the northwest of <a href=\"/wiki/Tulmon\" title=\"Tulmon\">Tulmon</a>,<sup id=\"cite_ref-EotSS-p167_2-5\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-EotSS-p167-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> along the <a href=\"/wiki/Narrows_Trail\" title=\"Narrows Trail\">Narrows Trail</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> From its place along the <a href=\"/wiki/Lake_of_Steam\" title=\"Lake of Steam\">Lake of Steam</a>, Yeshpek dominated the natural harbor of <a href=\"/wiki/Bezrim_Bay\" title=\"Bezrim Bay\">Bezrim Bay</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-EotSS-p167_2-6\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-EotSS-p167-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trade\">Trade</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Trade\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Yeshpek?veaction=edit&section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Trade\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Yeshpek was a center of trade of fishing.<sup id=\"cite_ref-EotSS-p167_2-7\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-EotSS-p167-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> It was known for its exportation of finely wrought <a href=\"/wiki/Chain\" title=\"Chain\">chains</a>,<sup id=\"cite_ref-EotSS-p167_2-8\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-EotSS-p167-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-MLoSaDC_1-4\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-MLoSaDC-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> of different sizes and strengths,<sup id=\"cite_ref-MLoSaDC_1-5\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-MLoSaDC-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> as well as locks. It was also known for trading of <a href=\"/wiki/Crab\" title=\"Crab\">crabs</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Clam\" title=\"Clam\">clams</a>. Beyond that, its populace crafted a variety of small everyday goods, such as belts, <span class=\"new\" title=\"Coffer (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ29mZmVyP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">carry-coffers</span>, <a href=\"/wiki/Jug\" title=\"Jug\">jugs</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Whetstone\" title=\"Whetstone\">sharpening steels</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-EotSS-p167_2-9\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-EotSS-p167-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notable_Locations\">Notable Locations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Notable Locations\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Yeshpek?veaction=edit&section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Notable Locations\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Businesses\">Businesses</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Businesses\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Yeshpek?veaction=edit&section=5\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Businesses\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Hyderfaulcon%27s_House\" title=\"Hyderfaulcon's House\">Hyderfaulcon's House</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/The_Dancer%27s_Blushing_Mask\" title=\"The Dancer's Blushing Mask\">The Dancer's Blushing Mask</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/The_Fairshorn_Wheel_Inn\" title=\"The Fairshorn Wheel Inn\">The Fairshorn Wheel Inn</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Malasarr%27s_Wayhouse_Inn\" title=\"Malasarr's Wayhouse Inn\">Malasarr's Wayhouse Inn</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Temples\">Temples</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Temples\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Yeshpek?veaction=edit&section=6\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Temples\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bright_Anvil\" title=\"Bright Anvil\">Bright Anvil</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bloody_Sash\" title=\"Bloody Sash\">Bloody Sash</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Roads\">Roads</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Roads\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Yeshpek?veaction=edit&section=7\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Roads\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Way_of_Trumpets\" title=\"Way of Trumpets\">Way of Trumpets</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Inhabitants\">Inhabitants</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Inhabitants\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Yeshpek?veaction=edit&section=8\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Inhabitants\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>As of <a href=\"/wiki/1372_DR\" title=\"1372 DR\">1372 DR</a>, its population was around 23,000,<sup id=\"cite_ref-EotSS-p167_2-10\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-EotSS-p167-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-MLoSaDC_1-6\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-MLoSaDC-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> with 19,000 of them being proper citizens of the city and other 4,200 being laborers who lived on its outskirts.<sup id=\"cite_ref-EotSS-p167_2-11\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-EotSS-p167-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>Beyond Yeshpek, elsewhere in the Realms its inhabitants were often known for being <a href=\"/wiki/Mercenaries\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mercenaries\">mercenaries</a><sup id=\"cite_ref-EotSS-p167_2-12\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-EotSS-p167-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-MLoSaDC_1-7\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-MLoSaDC-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> or caravan guards,<sup id=\"cite_ref-EotSS-p167_2-13\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-EotSS-p167-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> often reckless ones who opposed authority.<sup id=\"cite_ref-EotSS-p167_2-14\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-EotSS-p167-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-MLoSaDC_1-8\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-MLoSaDC-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> They were also known for being critical of others and viewing ostentatious shows of wealth and spending to be wasteful, despite displaying pride over their own goods.<sup id=\"cite_ref-MLoSaDC_1-9\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-MLoSaDC-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appendix\">Appendix</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Appendix\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Yeshpek?veaction=edit&section=9\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Appendix\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"metadata plainlinks stub\"><tbody><tr>\n<td><i>This article is incomplete.</i>  <i>You can help the Forgotten Realms Wiki by providing more information.</i></td>\n</tr></tbody></table>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: References\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Yeshpek?veaction=edit&section=10\" aria-label=\"Edit section: References\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<div class=\"reflist\">\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite_note-MLoSaDC-1\"><span c